@aurumproptech.in)\n\n## Top Properties in Mumbai\n\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\n![Pexo Icon](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2Fassets%2Fpexo-ai%2Fpexo-strip.png&w=640&q=75)\n\nAsk Pulse Ai anything about real estate\n\nYour AI companion is available 24/7 — home loans, listings, market trends\n\n![pexo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2FshadowPexocha.webp&w=1200&q=75)\n\n## Unlock the Latest in Real Estate\n\nNews, Infographics, Blogs & More! Delivered to your inbox.\n\n[![Proptech Pulse Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Ffrontend%2FcommonAssets%2Fpulse_logo_latest.png&w=1200&q=75)](#home)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parć, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parć, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### Reach Out to Us\n\n* Aurum Q1, Aurum Q Parc, Thane Belapur Road, Navi Mumbai 400710, India\n* [+91 22 6911 1800](tel:+912269111800)\n* [pulse@aurumproptech.in](mailto:pulse@aurumproptech.in)\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\n### “Data that drives action. Insight that inspires action. Technology that empowers action.“\n\nMade with Love\n\n![Statue](/frontend/assets/aurum-kuberx/flag.webp)\n\n© PropTech Pulse 2026, All rights reserved.\n\n[Terms of Use](/pulse/terms-of-use) and [Privacy Policy](/pulse/privacy-policy)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/krishna-heritage-kandivali/146473/project","title":"Krishna Heritage Kandivali, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹76.23 Lac Onwards | 1, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Krishna Enterprise Mumbai developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/krishna-enterprise-mumbai-16677.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Krishna Heritage Kandivali Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Krishna Heritage Kandivali Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/krishna-heritage-kandivali-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-1140;h-350;crop;)\n\n**₹76.23 Lac - 1.63 Cr**\n\n₹19,513 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Krishna Heritage Kandivali?\n\n## About Krishna Heritage Kandivali, Kandivali West by Krishna Enterprise Mumbai\n\nIntroducing Krishna Heritage Kandivali, a prestigious real-estate project located in Kandivali West, one of the most sought-after residential destinations in Mumbai. The project offers a unique blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience, with its strategic location connecting to prominent roads such as New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, and Western Express Highway, ensuring seamless connectivity to major suburbs and commercial hubs.\n\nThe project features a range of modern amenities, including kids play areas and sand pits for the young ones, and power backup for added convenience. Each apartment features exceptional specifications, with oil-bound distemper paint on the master bedroom walls, ensuring a premium living experience. Whether you re a young professional, a growing family, or a retiree, Krishna Heritage Kandivali has something to offer for everyone.\n\nInvest in a luxurious 1 BHK apartment with an area of 477 Sq. Ft. priced at 76.23 Lac, or opt for a spacious 3 BHK apartment with 881 Sq. Ft. of area, available at 1.41 Cr, or the grand 3 BHK apartment with 1017 Sq. Ft. of area, priced at 1.63 Cr. Make Krishna Heritage Kandivali your home and experience the best of Mumbai living.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Krishna Heritage Kandivali:\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 1 BHK Apartment | 477 | 76.23 Lac |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 881 | 1.41 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1017 | 1.63 Cr |\n\nThis residential project is situated near several significant landmarks, offering residents an unparalleled blend of convenience, comfort, and connectivity. These landmarks enhance the quality of life for residents and provide easy access to essential amenities and services.\n\nIn resale we have 1 properties available ranging from 3 BHK having price from 3.50 CR\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 1 | 3 BHK | 3.50 CR |\n\nThis recent quarter has witnessed a robust real estate market, with government-registered transactions indicating a consistent rental rate of 72.417 across all aggregations, including a 3-month, 6-month, and 1-year span. The current rate remains steady at 18,624, signifying a stable market trend. A significant uptick is observed in sales transactions, with a cumulative total of 7 transactions recorded over the past year, resulting in a gross sales value of 11 Cr, comprising of a single transaction worth 1 Cr, 2 transactions valued at 3 Cr, and 4 transactions valued at 7 Cr}\n\n## Krishna Heritage Kandivali Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Krishna Heritage Kandivali.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  477 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 76.23 Lac** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  881 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.41 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1017 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.63 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nKrishna Heritage Kandivali's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Krishna Heritage Kandivali | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 22050 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 22750 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 21500 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 21500 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nKrishna Heritage Kandivali avg. price is ₹ 22.1 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Paradigm Casa Palazzo](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-casa-palazzo/100549/project \"Paradigm Casa Palazzo\") | ₹ 30,400 |\n| [Paradigm Codename True Value](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/paradigm-codename-true-value/102364/project \"Paradigm Codename True Value\") | ₹ 30,050 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n| [Ariana Residency](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ariana-residency/28520/project \"Ariana Residency\") | ₹ 24,900 |\n| Current Project **Krishna Heritage Kandivali** | ₹ 22,050 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Kandivali West ranges from ₹ 24.2 K to ₹ 75.6 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Krishna Heritage Kandivali | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Krishna Heritage Kandivali.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Krishna Heritage Kandivali, amounting to ₹ 2 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### New Road Link Approved to Enhance Mumbai Connectivity\n\nThe Maharashtra government has approved a ₹1,722 crore road link project aimed at connecting the Versova-Bandra Sea Link with the Mumbai Coastal Road. This infrastructure development is expected to significantly improve traffic flow, reduce commuting times across the city.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### Goregaon-Mulund Link Road Project Receives ₹2,650 Crore in BMC Budget\n\nThe Goregaon-Mulund Link Road project has been allocated ₹2,650 crore in the BMC's FY26-27 budget. This crucial east-west connectivity project, which involves the construction of a 4.7 km twin-tube tunnel under the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, aims to ease traffic congestion on the Ghodbunder Road.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nA total of 2 out of 36 launched units have been booked as of April 2026, including 3% of 3 BHK(1 out of 34), 100% of SHOP (1 units).\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Krishna Heritage Kandivali moved from ₹ 21,500/sqft to ₹ 22,750/sqft, reflecting a 5.81% rise.\n\n#### Mumbai Local Trains Face Cancellations for Infrastructure Upgrade\n\nWestern Railway is undertaking essential infrastructure upgrades between Kandivali and Borivali from December 21, 2025, to January 18, 2026, leading to the daily cancellation of over 80 local trains. This includes work on tracks and crossovers, impacting suburban, passenger, and express train services. Nightly mega blocks are also in effect, causing further service disruptions.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Krishna Heritage Kandivali From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 17.5 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 2 Cr | ₹ 17,500 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Krishna Heritage Kandivali Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 477 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Krishna Heritage Kandivali, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 76.23 Lac\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 881 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Krishna Heritage Kandivali, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.41 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1017 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Krishna Heritage Kandivali, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.63 Cr\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Krishna Heritage Kandivali\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Krishna Enterprise Mumbai Kandivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Krishna Heritage Kandivali.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Krishna Heritage Kandivali](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/krishna-heritage-kandivali-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Swami Vivekanand International School & Junior College\n\n#### Kala Maruti Mandir\n\n#### Pratik Hospital & Maternity Home\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Kandivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway and major roads\n\nLimited public transport\n\nVery good for visit Kandivali west\n\n— Rajubhau Sasane, Real estate agent\n\n## RERA Details of Krishna Heritage Kandivali\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Krishna Heritage Kandivali From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 17.5 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-02-25 | Floor 19, Unit 1901 | N/A | 894 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Krishna Heritage Kandivali compare with similar projects?\n\n![Krishna Heritage Kandivali project in Kandivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-krishna-heritage-kandivali-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Krishna Heritage Kandivali](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/krishna-heritage-kandivali/146473/project \"Krishna Heritage Kandivali